--- !u!114 &1559697841
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1559697840}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2590899df56c4251afb713f17d204aca, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  walkingDialogue:
  - content: "Ah, Reichel. Thank you for joining me. I need your assistance. There
      may still be a path to helping Commander Ives... but I\u2019m sure you have
      questions first."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054491
    - rid: 1894806212798054492
    - rid: 1894806212798054493
    - rid: 1894806212798054494
    - rid: 1894806212798054495
  - content: "Yes, it\u2019s about the serums. You told Ives her serum was \"compromised.\""
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054483
    - rid: 1894806212798054484
    - rid: 1894806212798054485
    - rid: 1894806212798054486
    - rid: 1894806212798054487
  - content: An unfortunate reaction to an unknown catalyst in the field, yes.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054498
    - rid: 1894806212798054499
  - content: 'But how is that possible? The serums are individually inspected and
      sealed to prevent any possible contact contamination. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054500
    - rid: 1894806212798054501
  - content: "That is correct Reichel, but besides contact, there\u2019s another
      manner in which amplitude can be transferred that you are overlooking. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054502
    - rid: 1894806212798054503
  - content: 'Another method?  '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054504
    - rid: 1894806212798054505
  - content: Resonance.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054506
    - rid: 1894806212798054507
  - content: When the natural frequencies of two things are very similar, a release
      of energy from one can be almost entirely transferred to the other.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054508
  - content: Similar frequencies...? The serums already have a frequency greater
      than anything found on Earth. What could possibly be in the Tundra that matched
      those frequencies and released that much energy?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054510
    - rid: 1894806212798054509
  - content: The crystals...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054511
  - content: "They release massive amounts of energy when broken, and their frequencies
      are among the highest we\u2019ve discovered. If their frequencies are similar
      to the serum, they could resonate almost perfectly..."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054512
  - content: 'Excellent deduction, you are correct. The signatures of the serum are
      almost identical to those found in the crystals. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054520
    - rid: 1894806212798054521
  - content: But this is no coincidence, for the raw components of the serum are
      also not natural to Earth to begin with.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054522
  - content: They were extracted from the organic materials that came bound to the
      Waste when it arrived on Earth.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054523
  - content: After removing its amplitude, it acts as the perfect vector to contain
      the Waste once more.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054524
  - content: However, the crystals also arrived in tandem, and so it should be no
      surprise that they share such similar frequencies.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054525
  - content: "Damnation, but if you knew that the frequencies of the crystal are
      so similar to the serum, why didn\u2019t you say something? Ives wouldn\u2019t
      be in this position if we knew. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054526
    - rid: 1894806212798054528
  - content: '... Please, follow me to my lab. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054529
    - rid: 1894806212798054530
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054531
    - rid: 1894806212798054532
    - rid: 1894806212798054533
    - rid: 1894806212798054534
    - rid: 1894806212798054537
  blackDialogue:
  - content: There was an incident years ago.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054549
    - rid: 1894806212798054551
    - rid: 1894806212798054553
    - rid: 1894806212798054550
    - rid: 1894806212798054552
    - rid: 1894806212798054554
  - content: 'The first incursion into the Tundra, a scouting mission. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054555
  - content: 'The higher-ups claimed all personnel were killed or missing. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "But that\u2019s not the truth."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054557
  labDialogue:
  - content: 'These tanks... Are they creatures... or people? '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054558
    - rid: 1894806212798054559
    - rid: 1894806212798054564
    - rid: 1894806212798054565
    - rid: 1894806212798054560
    - rid: 1894806212798054561
    - rid: 1894806212798054562
  - content: "These were the scouts rescued from the mission. But, perhaps the answer
      to your question is not as clear as you\u2019d think."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054576
    - rid: 1894806212798054577
  - content: Are you familiar with the theory of Harmonics?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054578
  - content: The theory explaining the origins of the Waste creatures?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054580
    - rid: 1894806212798054579
  - content: Yes, when the Waste first infects a creature, it creates strong frequency
      dissonance.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054581
    - rid: 1894806212798054582
  - content: But if the host survives... the frequencies eventually reharmonize.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Harmonics are like octaves on a scale. The frequencies become stable
      at specific intervals, and the creature grows stronger, gaining new abilities.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054583
    - rid: 1894806212798054584
  - content: The open question was, could humans do the same?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: But that was deemed impossible, our frequencies are too high, and amplitude
      too low.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054585
    - rid: 1894806212798054586
  - content: An infected individual would run out of time and pass away from dissonance
      before coming remotely close to that threshold.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054588
  - content: Correct. I see you have gone over the readings. Under normal circumstances,
      that would be the sole outcome. But the key component is <i>time</i>.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054589
    - rid: 1894806212798054590
  - content: If there was a way to bypass the <i>time</i> required... to fuel the
      change with a massive influx of pure Amplitude...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054591
  - content: ...The injections. They could be used to reach the Second Harmonic.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054592
    - rid: 1894806212798054593
  - content: "And that\u2019s what happened to these Scouts."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054594
  - content: Yes, I saw it then, a brief, unstable glimpse of a human touching the
      Second Harmonic.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054595
    - rid: 1894806212798054596
  - content: Their energies and the Waste however, were uncontrolled and could not
      remain in a stable state.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054597
  - content: They lashed out against the rescue team, their power overwhelming. It
      was a slaughter.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: So you <i>did</i> know. You knew exactly what could happen, and you
      let us go in.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054598
    - rid: 1894806212798054599
  - content: "Because I\u2019ve been working in the dark for too long. I needed new
      data. I needed new samples. I needed the crystals."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054600
    - rid: 1894806212798054601
  - content: 'There was a good chance that everything would go smoothly and I would
      not have to expose my research yet. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: You... gambled with her life.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054602
    - rid: 1894806212798054603
  - content: No. It was a <i>calculated risk</i>.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054604
    - rid: 1894806212798054605
  - content: 'There are threats in this world, things you cannot yet fathom, that
      make the Waste look like a common cold. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'Our only chance as a species is to progress, to evolve. To move on
      and stop focusing on how to turn things back to the way they once were. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054608
  - content: To harness the Harmonics means to create a more resilient humanity.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Imagine a world where being permanently infected by the Waste isn\u2019t
      a curse, perhaps even a blessing. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: And your glove... it was a statistical anomaly for it to fail as it
      did.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054610
    - rid: 1894806212798054611
  - content: 'But why tell me all this then? What stops me from exposing this research
      now?  '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054612
  - content: Because, Reichel. I need your help. And you... you need mine.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054613
    - rid: 1894806212798054614
  - content: I need nothing from you.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054615
    - rid: 1894806212798054616
  - content: "Don\u2019t you? This is the fate that awaits Ives. Life in a tank."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054617
    - rid: 1894806212798054618
  - content: Enduring a slow, withering decay of mind and body that her field excursion
      will only accelerate. The only hope she has is this research. To stabilize
      her at the Second Harmonic. A contingency.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054619
    - rid: 1894806212798054620
  - content: What do you want?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054621
  - content: 'A partnership. One that is not one-sided. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054622
    - rid: 1894806212798054623
  - content: "So, I\u2019ll ask you, Reichel. What do you want?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054624
  - content: '... '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054625
    - rid: 1894806212798054626
  - content: I want to save her.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054627
  - content: Good. I want to save all of them. In that, we are aligned. I need your
      expertise in frequency modulation. Your gloves are the key to finding the precise
      stabilization point.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054628
    - rid: 1894806212798054629
  - content: ...And if I say no?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054630
    - rid: 1894806212798054631
  - content: "Then I continue alone. And Ives\u2019 time... runs out. Think it through.
      We have some time. In the meantime, I\u2019ll be heading back to the Tundra.
      To prevent... further complications."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054632
    - rid: 1894806212798054633
  - content: "(Weise turns to leave. Cam\u2019s voice stops him.)"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054634
  - content: I have a condition.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054635
    - rid: 1894806212798054636
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054637
    - rid: 1894806212798054638
  - content: "I\u2019ll help you. But if Ives is hurt any further, if you let anything
      happen to her on that mission... I will expose every last tank in this room.
      I\u2019ll burn this whole lab to the <i>ground</i>."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054639
    - rid: 1894806212798054640
  - content: '... '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054641
    - rid: 1894806212798054642
  - content: Fair enough. A deal, then.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054643
  - content: "But know this, Reichel. If you destroy this lab, you won\u2019t just
      be jeopardizing my life\u2019s work, you will be putting all their lives on
      the line as well. And Ives\u2019 blood will be on your hands."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76d5a271a719e8f4cad7429ce9e05c1c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1894806212798054644
